<h1>Problematic encounter order alert</h1>

<p>
  An order is in an unexpected state. Usually, this means payment <em>has</em>
  been made, but an unrecoverable error was then encountered when trying to
  update the order's state inside the web site.
</p>

<p>
  Please reconcile payment records against order entries in the
  <%= link_to('admin interface', @admin_url) %>.
<p>

<%= render partial: 'encounter_order', object: @encounter_order %>
